Comment: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:21.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:28.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.51,0:01:36.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Base left Northern Ireland\Nafter repulsing Char's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.79,0:01:38.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, hiding inside the ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:41.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...was a young woman who had\Nsnuck aboard under Char's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:43.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miharu Ratokie...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...wasn't a girl who had become\Na spy by choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.57,0:01:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.10,0:01:54.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger that, Ms. Sayla!{\i}\N{\i1}Here I go!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.39,0:02:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're gonna stall!\NPlease hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:13.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Docking completed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger. That's just 15 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:20.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was just as Amuro had pointed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When the Gundam docked to become G-Bull,\Nthe left side was totally unprotected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.81,0:02:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Finding a solution to cover\Nthis weakness in the armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:32.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...would be a top priority for improving\Nthe Gundam's modular system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:36.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base crew are presently\Nabove the Atlantic Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their destination...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The whale from the Federation Forces\Nwas a lot larger than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:20.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! We've received a message\Nfrom Captain Boone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From Boone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Boone. He sent a spy\Nto infiltrate the Trojan Horse...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.59,0:03:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But how does he plan to retrieve the intel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sneak into an officer's room.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First, find out their intended destination.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Second, collect any data on the{\i}\N{\i1}capabilities of the Trojan Horse.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:52.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have that information ready for me.{\i}\N{\i1}I'll contact you at 0500 hours.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:53.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:55.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's time to head up to the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:04:01.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Guess he's already gone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what tore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:14.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mr. Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.11,0:04:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\ND-Don't scare me like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.37,0:04:19.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:22.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:23.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.69,0:04:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's you, Miharu!\NWhy are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:29.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I came aboard this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:34.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then... Where'd you get that uniform...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:37.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You love your siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not true that you came here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.73,0:04:48.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not a lie!\NIt's... It's partly true...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sh... You'd better come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:04:59.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't ask such tactless questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is... Is she your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:06.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll drop her off in South America.\NSo keep it a secret, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:07.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,South America?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. I didn't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Appreciate it... See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The key code for the door is 3986.\NStay in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where in South America are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're headed for a spaceship dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:28.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's about all the information\Nyou're gonna get out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.35,0:05:32.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the White Base blew up before reaching\NSouth America, neither of us would survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:35.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:48.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll contact you on your wrist{\i}\N{\i1}radio at 0500 hours.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:51.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's not much time.\NWhat's he planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.05,0:05:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Civilian aircraft approaching\Nat 4 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:00.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's sending out a distress signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:02.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A distress signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:05.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's a civilian aircraft?\NCan you confirm that, Fraw Bow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! I'm confirming it right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to its registration number...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it belongs to a fishery union\Nin the Verde Islands, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Instruct them to enter from the rear deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open Deck 4!\NPrepare to dock a civilian plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll bet we're the first Zeons\Nto infiltrate the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:39.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:41.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Zeon accent is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:44.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:46.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry with that!\NIt'll catch fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were out checking for schools of fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:52.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Zeon fighter plane\Nstarted shooting at us for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:54.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About 20 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:58.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been shot with unexploded\N20mm shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:01.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll do makeshift repairs and provide you\Nwith enough fuel to get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:06.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, you'll be restricted to that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:08.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, that's fine with me...\NHey! Carioca!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:11.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll send a repair invoice to the union.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:14.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't charge too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey. You think anyone at the union\Nwill accept the invoice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:21.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:27.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh. Go straight, then turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:28.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:33.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Turn right, there!\NDon't go any further!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose this is all new to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:54.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No. 107. If you can speak aloud, answer me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:55.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, Where's the Trojan Horse heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A spaceship dock in South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.37,0:07:58.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:07:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good work.\NKeep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:02.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:08.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you contact them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:08.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:12.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you reach them from this distance?\NIt doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:14.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I think so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this is how my family and I\Nhave been able to feed ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:20.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:23.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm getting you in trouble.\NMe being a spy and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:28.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said a civilian aircraft came on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:30.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the only way they\Ncould reach you by radio!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:35.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen! Whatever happens after this\Nhas got nothing to do with you. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My sixth sense told me there's something\Nsuspicious about that civilian aircraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop! Someone make that aircraft stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're spies!\NShoot 'em down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Mr. Kai?\NThey're just fishermen...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:05.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's strange they approached\Nthe White Base at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:09.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bright! You sure those guys weren't spies?{\i}\N{\i1}Did you check it thoroughly? Eh?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:13.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, we checked it all out.\NWe frisked the pilots as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.53,0:09:16.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We even confirmed that the airplane\Ngenuinely belongs to a fishery union.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Y- Yeah, but still... It's possible that{\i}\N{\i1}Zeon soldiers stole the plane.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai. Do you happen to have any proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:28.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Um, no. It's just strange{\i}\N{\i1}that they'd come at this hour.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like things went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it's not the African front?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:48.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. They're definitely headed for a\Nspaceship dock in South America, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they're not coming this way, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Mad Angler has to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:56.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to observe\Nthe situation on the African front.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:58.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I used to be a pilot in my younger days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May I borrow the mobile armor, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:03.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Grabro...? It's certainly ready, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to call it "revenge", but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:09.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So far they've managed to sink\Nfour of my mobile suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:12.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please let me attack them.\NIf I use that mobile armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...even from this distance,\Nit'll catch up to the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, you have my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.83,0:10:43.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They still haven't gone.\NThey've appeared at 7 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:47.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way a submarine could\Ncatch up to us. Just watch for missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incoming! Missiles detected!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:52.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire rear missiles!\N7 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:10:59.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A second and third wave of missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Fourth and fifth wave\Napproaching from below!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attack the submarine!\NAll units standby!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:09.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:13.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's hard to decide what to deploy\Nwhen we barely know our opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:17.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're over the ocean, so the Guncannon\Nand Guntank are at a disadvantage. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:20.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai says mobile suits are heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:23.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think so too. In that case, let's use\Nthe Gundam and G-Fighter separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:25.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Objects approaching at 10 o'clock!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All hands, prepare for battle!{\i}\N{\i1}Three objects are approaching!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:33.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Portside! Put up a barrage!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:46.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's lift, all together now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:47.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:51.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are children on this ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:58.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take off in G-Armor mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:00.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can bolt out in mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.53,0:12:01.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got you now, Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:11.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge all of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:37.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro. Is the White Base badly damaged?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:45.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay. It looks like they\Nonly got part of the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:45.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What part of the ship was just hit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deck 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:55.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deck 2, give me a damage report!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:58.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:13:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wear this life jacket!\NIt's all for nothing if you don't survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:01.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:03.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me help, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:12.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-This is all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:13.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:17.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are in danger, Mr. Kai,\Nall because I gave them information...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.07,0:13:20.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The little information you gave them\Nwouldn't result in an attack like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:24.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Kai! I'm the one who...!\NThis is all my fault, Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.33,0:13:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh. Hey! Miharu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Amuro. Here we go. Gundam, bolt out!\N- Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:48.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that it?!\NTake this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you finally showed up, Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Confident in your underwater combat skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or are you underestimating ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:08.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Core Fighter power at 90, 95...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:11.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,100! 120! Launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:26.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All blocks, give me a damage report!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.55,0:14:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't we send out Kai's Core Fighter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The catapult's damaged.{\i}\N{\i1}We can't launch Core Fighters!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about the Gunperry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's equipped with anti-submarine missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.69,0:14:39.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uh. You're right, sir.{\i}\N{\i1}I'll get Kai on it right away.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:44.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow! Get them to open Deck 3!\NWe'll be sending out the Gunperry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!\NDeck 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare the Gunperry for launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:51.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai, where are you?\NPlease proceed to Deck 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai to Deck 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Kai to Deck 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:56.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miharu, hide someplace\Nwhere you can easily escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:15:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But everyone's fighting!\NLet me help! Please! I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:12.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...! You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:37.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've sunk Godard's Z'Gok!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fire's out...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:09.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's the White Base?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:14.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thruster output, decreased by 40 percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:18.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know! Tell the crew to aim well\Nbefore firing the anti-submarine missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.46,0:16:20.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow! How's the Gundam doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no response yet.\NI think he's struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:28.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, the Gundam isn't equipped\Nwith any weapons for underwater use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:29.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:37.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of weapons does this guy have\Nfor underwater combat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:38.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No good. If I don't lure him to the surface,\Nthe Gundam doesn't have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You foolishly came underwater\Nto fight against my Grabro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was your mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:55.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:01.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As I feared, the beam rifle's power...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...is halved when fired underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about that!\NI've got you now, Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:12.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:26.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, we're fine.\NThis is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:29.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good! You kids are brave and strong!\NKeep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:31.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai! Please give me the chance to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't let these kids die\Nwhen my sister and brother are safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:38.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kikka! Come on!\NThere're still some fires to put out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I go back, I'll just continue\Nbeing used by Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can't bear to just stand here,\Nwatching from the sidelines!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:49.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai! Please take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.51,0:17:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay! Where is Job right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's busy firing the machine guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:57.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come with me!\NI need a bombardier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:17:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can launch missiles, can't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:02.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:15.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So much for this mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:18.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's as helpless as a baby\Nbefore the power of my Grabro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you see the enemy blip\Nin the scope's cross-hairs, fire the missile!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.59,0:18:27.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:29.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.05,0:18:29.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm out of bullets and missiles!\NMr. Kai, please take over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You press one lever at a time!\NJust stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That one missed!\NNext one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:03.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miharu! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai! I pressed the lever but it won't fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! Not now, at a time like this...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:13.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no good...\NThat attack damaged the electrical circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:15.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can we defeat the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.76,0:19:19.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only we could move the lever\Non the side of the catapult...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:21.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miharu! Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai! You said there's a lever\Non the side of the catapult, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miharu! It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:37.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is... Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:42.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miharu! Listen, you gotta do it properly!\NYou know how to do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai! Steer the plane toward the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai! The enemy's coming straight at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Miharu! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's finish you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:36.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other Z'Gok was destroyed as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your mistake was tearing off\Nthe Gundam's leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:47.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's allowed me to move more easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:08.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miharu! What's keeping you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:10.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come back up here, Miharu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:12.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Kai! Watch out!{\i}\N{\i1}You gotta land on the ship now!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And this Miharu disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Apparently, she and Kai launched\Ntogether on the Gunperry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:29.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just who is she?\NDo you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, sir. Nobody knows her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.19,0:21:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was a stowaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A stowaway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you knew her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:47.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.79,0:21:51.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw a young lady go into Mr. Kai's room...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:53.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then the enemy showed up, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:22:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miharu... She's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.41,0:22:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so glad I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.87,0:22:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, Gil and Milly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:40.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no need to worry about them...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.05,0:22:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They'll live a much better life than we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:50.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After all, the world won't be this awful\Nforever, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right, Kai?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:20.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Federation Forces Headquarters at Jaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.34,0:23:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Char commands an assault on the base...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.67,0:23:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1476.14,1031.83)}´
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.67,0:23:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...while Amuro runs into Matilda's fiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.97,0:23:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,War mercilessly destroys a life...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:32.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...as well as anger, and sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.02,0:23:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam.\NTragedy in Jaburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:39.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you be able to survive?
