Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:21.50,Song ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur2\c&HE8E8E8&\1a&HFF&}Rage on! Rage on! Rage on! Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:27.75,Song ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur2\c&HE8E8E8&\1a&HFF&}You must run forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.29,0:00:34.76,Song ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur2\c&HE8E8E8&\1a&HFF&}If you are still burning with furious rage...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.39,Song ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur2\c&HE8E8E8&\1a&HFF&}You must fight the towering foe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:41.47,Song ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur2\c&HE8E8E8&\1a&HFF&}Fight! Fight! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:48.27,Song ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur2\c&HE8E8E8&\1a&HFF&}Bring to bear the rage of justice, Gundam
